      "claim": "Explicit fade extents are computed from event+90/+98. Fade-in getter delegates through MFade object+10 interpolator virtual+1a0. Fade-out getter computes RN64(RN64(event+70+event+68)-interpolatorExtent); its subsequent context conversion is distinct from the fade-in duration conversion. Exact serialized interpolator semantics remain unresolved."
    },
    {
      "addresses": [
        "0x10020f7b8",
